WEBVTT

00:17:29.337 --> 00:17:31.715
The real challenge is up to you:

00:17:31.715 --> 00:17:34.913
to take this tool and figure out
how we can use it

00:17:34.913 --> 00:17:37.878
all across America and around the world,

00:17:37.878 --> 00:17:41.462
so that instead of recording
thousands of StoryCorps interviews a year,

00:17:41.462 --> 00:17:44.232
we could potentially record
tens of thousands

00:17:44.232 --> 00:17:46.188
or hundreds of thousands

00:17:46.188 --> 00:17:48.185
or maybe even more.

00:17:49.355 --> 00:17:53.093
Imagine, for example,
a national homework assignment

00:17:53.093 --> 00:17:57.087
where every high school student
studying U.S. history across the country

00:17:57.087 --> 00:17:59.989
records an interview
with an elder over Thanksgiving,

00:17:59.989 --> 00:18:02.892
so that in one single weekend